0..52 Comment "//! `joined` closes a task end before a scope exits."
53..56 Comment "//!"
57..136 Comment "//! A scope clause can drop or resume its remaining continuation twice. After a"
137..187 Comment "//! parent joins, the rest holds no task resource."
188..191 Comment "//!"
192..271 Comment "//! The handler forks, receives and closes the task. The exit operation resumes"
272..302 Comment "//! the continuation as `*{}`."
303..306 Comment "//!"
307..384 Comment "//! - see: `authority.gandr` — a parent exits while its task end stays open"
386..425 Comment "// The import gives the task protocols."
